WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:03.475
Here's a tour of the daily plan, section by section.

00:03.395 --> 00:05.093
We're using the free sample page,

00:05.093 --> 00:07.329
so every number here is an example.

00:07.679 --> 00:09.770
You get a separate plan for each market,

00:09.770 --> 00:12.831
ES and NQ, every trading day.

00:12.751 --> 00:15.803
They read the same way, so let's walk through ES.

00:16.153 --> 00:17.673
Up top is the bias.

00:17.593 --> 00:18.717
It's the day's lean.

00:18.717 --> 00:21.048
Bullish, bearish, or neutral.

00:20.968 --> 00:23.840
Neutral means no edge until price shows you one.

00:24.190 --> 00:26.288
Next, the failed-breakdown longs,

00:26.288 --> 00:27.824
ranked best first.

00:27.744 --> 00:29.130
Gold is the main spot.

00:29.130 --> 00:30.474
Silver is the backup.

00:30.474 --> 00:31.759
Bronze is deeper.

00:31.679 --> 00:33.025
Each reads the same way.

00:33.025 --> 00:34.959
Flush below it, reclaim it,

00:34.959 --> 00:36.966
then long toward the first target.

00:37.316 --> 00:38.161
Then the rule.

00:38.161 --> 00:41.155
Wait for acceptance, then manage level to level.

00:41.075 --> 00:43.743
Acceptance means price holds back above the level,

00:43.743 --> 00:45.424
instead of knifing through it.

00:45.344 --> 00:47.917
Level to level means you bank the first target

00:47.917 --> 00:49.156
and trail a runner.

00:49.506 --> 00:52.248
Every setup also has an invalidation level.

00:52.168 --> 00:53.968
That's where the long idea is wrong,

00:53.968 --> 00:55.291
so you stand aside.

00:55.211 --> 00:57.094
No reclaim, no trade.

00:57.444 --> 01:01.324
Members also get the full support and resistance ladder on Today's Plan,

01:01.324 --> 01:03.718
plus the chart and the TradingView code.

01:03.638 --> 01:06.347
The same plan lands by email and Telegram.

01:06.697 --> 01:09.358
Stuck on a term? The glossary explains it.

01:09.278 --> 01:09.900
Bias,

01:09.900 --> 01:11.114
failed breakdown,

01:11.114 --> 01:11.975
acceptance,

01:11.975 --> 01:13.324
and level to level.

01:13.697 --> 01:14.984
Full plan available.

01:14.904 --> 01:15.885
Grab a free sample at

01:15.885 --> 01:18.920
tradelevelspro.com/sample.

01:18.840 --> 01:21.657
Educational only. Not financial advice.
